      370.56,
      554.65,
      428.63
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Urban Development Projects (Special Provisions) Act No. 2 of 1980,I, Maithripala Sirisena, President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka upon the recommendation of the Minister-in-Charge of the subject of Ministry of Megapolis and Western Development, being of the opinion that the lands specifiedin the schedules I and II hereto are urgently required for the purposes of mix development Housing Project and resettlementof underserved settlers respectively do by this order, declare that the said lands are required for such purposes.",
